midori-performance-enforcement-flexible = Flexible budget
midori-performance-enforcement-pending = Pending support

midori-performance-enforcement-limited = Limited
midori-performance-enforcement-checking = Applying…
midori-performance-enforcement-pending-range = Rate unsupported
midori-performance-enforcement-error = Check limit
midori-performance-enforcement-protected-budget = Protected memory budget
midori-performance-enforcement-protected-excess = Preserving active work
midori-performance-state-protected-excess = The budget is temporarily exceeded to preserve active tabs, calls and other protected activity. Inactive tabs will be paused when safe.
midori-performance-network-checking = Checking that the network limits have been applied.
midori-performance-network-pending-range = Saved. Each rate must be at most 17179.869176 Mbit/s to activate the current limiter. Traffic is not capped.
